---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ERP for Healthcare & Clinics | Ecosoft"
  description="Ecosoft implements Odoo and ERPNext for healthcare operators — medical supply chain, procurement, inventory, and Thai accounting compliance."
>


  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Industry — Healthcare</p>
      <h1>Back-office ERP for healthcare operators — so clinical teams can focus on patients.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Healthcare businesses have complex back-office requirements — medical supply procurement, controlled
        inventory management, multi-branch operations, and strict compliance requirements.
        Ecosoft implements Odoo and ERPNext to handle the business operations layer,
        so clinical teams can focus on care delivery.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Healthcare ERP Consultation</a>
        <a href="/solutions/erp-odoo" class="btn btn-outline">Explore Odoo Modules</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- USE CASES -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="text-align:center;">Healthcare back-office requirements</h2>
      <div class="cards-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">💊</div>
          <h4>Medical supply procurement</h4>
          <p>RFQ-to-PO workflows for medical consumables and equipment, with supplier management, approved vendor lists, and 3-way matching on delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">📦</div>
          <h4>Lot-tracked inventory</h4>
          <p>Full lot and expiry date tracking for medical supplies — with FEFO (first expired, first out) stock movement and expiry alerts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">🏥</div>
          <h4>Multi-branch operations</h4>
          <p>Centralised procurement and accounting with branch-level stock management — for clinic groups and healthcare operators across multiple locations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">💰</div>
          <h4>Thai accounting compliance</h4>
          <p>Revenue recognition, VAT, withholding tax, and financial reporting for healthcare operators — compliant with Thai Revenue Department requirements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">📋</div>
          <h4>Asset management</h4>
          <p>Medical equipment register, maintenance scheduling, depreciation, and disposal workflows — aligned with accounting standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">👥</div>
          <h4>HR & payroll</h4>
          <p>Staff records, leave management, and Thai payroll — covering clinical staff, support staff, and management with a single HR system.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NOTE ON SCOPE -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;">
        <h2>What we implement — and what we don't</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Ecosoft focuses on the business operations layer — procurement, inventory, HR, accounting, and analytics.
          We do not implement clinical management systems (HIS) or electronic medical records (EMR).
          Our ERP implementations are often deployed alongside a clinical system — handling the business
          processes that sit around patient care.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Discuss your requirements →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Running a healthcare business in Thailand?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your back-office challenges — we'll assess whether open-source ERP is the right fit and what an implementation would look like.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Free Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
